#: data/text/pkmn_center_nurse.inc:1
msgctxt "gText_WouldYouLikeToRestYourPkmn"
msgid ""
"Hello, and welcome to\n"
"the POKéMON CENTER.\p"
"We restore your tired POKéMON\n"
"to full health.\p"
"Would you like to rest your POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
"你好，欢迎来到\n"
"宝可梦中心。\p"
"这里可以为你的宝可梦\n"
"恢复体力。\p"
"要让你的宝可梦休息吗？$"

#: data/text/pkmn_center_nurse.inc:8
msgctxt "gText_IllTakeYourPkmn"
msgid ""
"Okay, I'll take your POKéMON\n"
"for a few seconds.$"
msgstr ""
"好的，请把你的宝可梦\n"
"交给我一会儿。$"

#: data/text/pkmn_center_nurse.inc:12
msgctxt "gText_RestoredPkmnToFullHealth"
msgid ""
"Thank you for waiting.\p"
"We've restored your POKéMON\n"
"to full health.$"
msgstr ""
"让你久等了。\p"
"你的宝可梦\n"
"已经恢复健康了。$"

#: data/text/pkmn_center_nurse.inc:17
msgctxt "gText_WeHopeToSeeYouAgain"
msgid "We hope to see you again!$"
msgstr "期待你再次光临！$"

#: data/text/pkmn_center_nurse.inc:20
msgctxt "gText_WelcomeCutShort"
msgid ""
"Hello, and welcome to\n"
"the POKéMON CENTER.\p"
"We restore your tired POKéMON\n"
"to full health.\p"
"Would you like to…$"
msgstr ""
"你好，欢迎来到\n"
"宝可梦中心。\p"
"这里可以为你的宝可梦\n"
"恢复体力。\p"
"要让你的宝可梦……$"

#: data/text/pkmn_center_nurse.inc:27
msgctxt "gText_NoticesGoldCard"
msgid ""
"Th-that card…\n"
"Could it be… The GOLD CARD?!\p"
"Oh, the gold color is brilliant!\n"
"The four stars seem to sparkle!\p"
"I've seen several TRAINERS with\n"
"a SILVER CARD before, but, {PLAYER},\l"
"you're the first TRAINER I've ever\l"
"seen with a GOLD CARD!\p"
"Okay, {PLAYER}, please allow me\n"
"the honor of resting your POKéMON!$"
msgstr ""
"这、这张卡……\n"
"难道是……金卡？！\p"
"哇，金色的光芒好耀眼！\n"
"四颗星星闪闪发光！\p"
"我见过好几位持有银卡的训练家，\n"
"但{PLAYER}，你是我见过的\l"
"第一位持有金卡的训练家！\p"
"好的，{PLAYER}，请让我荣幸地\n"
"为你的宝可梦恢复体力吧！$"

#: data/text/pkmn_center_nurse.inc:39
msgctxt "gText_YouWantTheUsual"
msgid ""
"I'm delighted to see you, {PLAYER}!\n"
"You want the usual, am I right?$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}，见到你真高兴！\n"
"还是老样子，对吧？$"

